abstract: >-
  A reproducible study of how generative AI may alter provenance, governance,
  and knowledge production on crowdsourced music-information platforms, using
  Album of the Year and Rate Your Music as motivating cases. The repository
  separates observed archives, controlled comparisons, synthetic method
  checks, and assumption-driven scenarios, and states the inferential limits
  of each evidence class.
keywords:
  - generative AI
  - platform governance
  - data provenance
  - music information
  - computational social science
